				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-10820043#post-4257359</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-10820043/adoption-poster:lloyd#post-4257359</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 22 May 2019 11:25:22 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Monteparnas</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2926286</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I'm just not very fond of the last exchange.</p> <p>WWS seems pretty much aware that no one should know of the anomalous nature of their critters outside the anomalous communities of Boring and Three-Portlands. And they know their website is visited outside of those.</p> <p>To blatantly admit to a random mailer that Lloyd is more than an animal seems out of place, even more so if this person clearly isn't buying it. It was too much for me.</p> <p>EDIT: It just occurred to me that Lloyd itself, whatever it is, wrote the last e-mail. Changed my vote.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
